  "description": "RFC 8785 JCS conformance corpus for VAL-W10-016..020. Each case pins the canonical UTF-8 byte string and SHA-256 digest. Both relay_verifier (Python) and @epochly/relay-verifier (TS) MUST produce byte-equal canonical output and the same digest. Reject cases assert that NaN/Inf raise the JCS-encode error.",
